  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the recent UI update, when typing in the text chatbox in Desktop Mode using a Japanese IME, the predictive conversion (candidate) window completely overlaps the input text field. \n\nBecause of this, I have to type without being able to see what characters I am currently entering, which makes communication extremely difficult. For users who rely heavily on text chat to communicate, this is a critical issue.\n\nCould you please adjust the UI layout or the IME window positioning so that the predictive text doesn't hide the chatbox input? Thank you.",
